{"ID":"20240314091825-m588e65","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091825-m588e65","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091825-m588e65\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170946-4dr5hxv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170946-8u41duk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170946-8u41duk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:119,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:119\u0026#125;","title":"【干姜人参半夏丸】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422170946"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422170946-4dr5hxv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170946-4dr5hxv","updated":"20240422170946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"妊娠呕吐不止，干姜人参半夏丸主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170946-23g75n2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170946-23g75n2","updated":"20240422170946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"干姜人参半夏丸方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170946-dvbh3ia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170946-dvbh3ia","updated":"20240422170946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"干姜人参各一两半夏二两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170946-5wp5ijv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170946-5wp5ijv","updated":"20240422170946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味末之，以生姜汁糊为丸，梧子大，饮服十丸，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170946-1g33ly2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170946-1g33ly2","updated":"20240422170946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接下来这个处方呢，是使用最多的，就是我们的干姜人参半夏汤，干姜人参半夏汤呢是专门应用在妇人在怀孕中间的时候强烈的呕吐。好不好呢？我告诉诸位，一剂就知。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170946-ikprcwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170946-ikprcwp","updated":"20240422170946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一次吃下去就好了很多了，你不要吃完一剂就不要吃了对不对？因为每个人的强弱不一样，但是病人会告诉你，那医生那药真好，我吃完你第一包药就好了八成了，那你就继续让她吃。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"怀孕她呕吐不止，是因为胃中焦冷"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"干姜能够温中"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，中焦冷的时候会有胃里面会有停水，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏能够把水去掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那吐得很厉害，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"人参把肠胃伤到的津液再补回去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这就是这个处方的方义。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170946-b6jq1j2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170946-b6jq1j2","updated":"20240422170946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那你临床上去你去做，临床是吃粉啊，然后用生姜汁呢把它们糊在一起吞下去。那你现在呢如果诊所没有这个药丸没有关系，你把 3 个粉拿起来给她吃下去也会好，那有些病人呢很龟毛，说我不要吃这个粉，因为不好吞嘛！那我放在胶囊里面可不可以？一样。你如果把它放在胶囊里面，一样会有效。所以你现在了解了以后，如果平常胃里就比较虚寒的人，这种人一怀孕呢就会呕吐，吐的很凶，所以平常就要保养的很好啊！"}]},{"ID":"20240422170946-8u41duk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170946-8u41duk","updated":"20240422170946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"光是这个处方啊，大家不晓得可以救多少妇女啊！那美国的西医很好玩，她在那吐嘛，他说怀孕会吐很正常，那吐得很严重的时候，他就看看里面是怎么回事，反正弄了半天就不会好。我们这个处方、经方到现在那么多年啊！处方都不用改变，真的都是一剂就可以知道。"}]}]}